.IX Title "PTBLENDER 1"
.TH PTBLENDER 1 2025-11-20 "Version: 2.9.23" "LIBPANO13 TOOLS"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
PTblender \- Colour and brightness correction of panoramas
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBPTblender\fR [options] \fItiff_file(s)\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBPTblender\fR is a command\-line tool that only implements the colour
and brightness correction functionality of \fBPTmender\fR.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP "\fB\-p\fR \fIprefix\fR" 4
.IX Item "-p prefix"
Prefix for output filename. Defaults to \fIblended%4d\fR.
.IP "\fB\-k\fR \fIindex\fR" 4
.IX Item "-k index"
Index of the image to use as a reference (0\-based, defaults to 0).
.IP "\fB\-t\fR \fI[0,1,2]\fR" 4
.IX Item "-t [0,1,2]"
Type of colour correction: 0 full (default), 1 brightness only, 2
colour only.
.IP \fB\-c\fR 4
.IX Item "-c"
Output curves smooth (output one per each corrected file).
.IP \fB\-m\fR 4
.IX Item "-m"
Output curves arbitrary map (output one per each corrected file).
.IP \fB\-f\fR 4
.IX Item "-f"
Force processing (ignore warnings).
.IP \fB\-x\fR 4
.IX Item "-x"
Delete source files (use with care).
.IP \fB\-q\fR 4
.IX Item "-q"
Quiet run.
.IP \fB\-h\fR 4
.IX Item "-h"
Output help summary.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
<http://wiki.panotools.org/PTblender>, \fBPTmender\fR\|(1)
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.IX Header "AUTHORS"
Panorama Tools was originally created by Professor Helmut Dersch, it\*(Aqs
now maintained by Bruno Postle <bruno@postle.net>.
